  the established full preparation path. Texture-sample hazard tracking still
  advances on each accepted hit. `ps3_rsx_stats 1` now reports
  `ui_state_hits`, allowing a physical trace to measure the saved preparation
  calls. A complete 512-state predicate sweep admitted only the one fully
  prepared state and rejected all 511 mutations. This optimization is common
  to Custom/720p/1080p, mono/stereo, all filters, both framebuffer layouts,
  and every quality setting; it does not target or select a preferred profile.
