  output resolution, filter, framebuffer layout, quality option, and both eyes
  of stereo. v1.83's explicit-triangle text and v1.82's final-light cache remain
  active. This is an update-only physical-test release; no RPCS3 resources
  were used.
- v1.83 removes the last hardware primitive-assembly ambiguity from green/white
